<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Your Amaizing subscription is ready to activate</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF">
    <mj-wrapper css-class="container" padding="0">
      <adv-header />

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Hi <strong>{{ first_name }}, </strong>
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text> Great to have you on board! </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Here’s your link to activate your subscription for
          {{ number_of_asins }} ASINs:
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <ai-btn-ico
        classes="btn-wrapper"
        href="{{ stripe_link }}"
        iconSrc="https://app-stg.amaizing.io/pngs/arrow-circle-right.png"
        >Activate My Subscription</ai-btn-ico
      >

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          <strong>Your Plan: </strong> {{ plan_name }} @ ${{ plan_price }}/month
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text> What’s included: </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-raw>
          <ul style="padding-left: 26px; margin: 0;"> <li><strong>Weekly
          Advantage Reports </strong> – every competitive shift in your market,
          explained and delivered fast, directly to you</li>
          <li><strong>Continuous competitor monitoring</strong> – pricing,
          reviews, listing changes, and sales rank movements tracked 24/7</li>
          <li><strong>Deep Dive Analyses</strong> – strategic intelligence on
          your biggest questions, delivered in 48-72 hours</li>
          <li><strong>Expert Support</strong> – questions about your market?
          Reply to any report and our team responds</li> </ul>
        </mj-raw>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Once payment is confirmed, your monitoring continues without
          interruption. Your next Advantage Report will arrive next week as
          usual.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          Questions or need to adjust your plan? Just reply to this email.
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para classes="greeting-text">
        <mj-text> Thanks, </mj-text>
      </para>

      <para>
        <mj-text>
          The
          <strong
            >Am<span style="color: #088ab2; text-decoration: underline">ai</span
            >zing</strong
          >
          Team
        </mj-text>
      </para>

      <adv-footer />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
